          "text": "In 2020, virtual backgrounds went from \"corporate novelty\" to \"daily necessity.\" Four years later, everyone has the same problem: the default backgrounds are generic, the stock photo backgrounds are boring, and the custom background you tried to make in Canva at midnight looks exactly like you made it at midnight."
        }
