        {
          "_key": "jla0tbx7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "AI background generation solves this. Generate a unique, professional virtual background in seconds. Create matching wallpaper sets for every device. Design seamless patterns for fabric, wrapping paper, and products. The technology handles the technical requirements (resolution, aspect ratio, seamless tiling) automatically — you just describe what you want."
