          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "\"Seamless\" is a promise, not a guarantee."
        },
        {
          "_key": "b8cewrat",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " AI-generated seamless patterns should always be verified at 3×3 repeat before exporting for production. About 10-15% of \"seamless\" AI patterns have visible seams at the repeat boundary. Lovart's 3×3 preview catches these before export."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "yzg6cat9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "jbten0kw",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Zoom compresses backgrounds heavily."
        },
        {
          "_key": "g9t686t2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Your pristine 4K virtual background gets compressed to a fraction of its quality by videoconferencing software. Bold, simple designs survive compression. Detailed, subtle designs become mud. Design for compression, not for your 4K monitor."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fjgpt55l",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
