          "_key": "s1hv8ee6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "The background market is saturated — niche is everything."
        },
        {
          "_key": "cb7fqi4q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " \"Abstract backgrounds\" is too broad. \"Hand-drawn botanical seamless patterns for sustainable baby clothing brands\" is a niche. AI handles the generation; you define the niche."
